Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.80,0:00:05.63,,,0,0,0,,«Blue is the colour»\N♪ 蓝色是我们的颜色 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.78,0:00:11.73,,,0,0,0,,Blue is the colour\N♪ 蓝色是我们的颜色 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.73,0:00:14.60,,,0,0,0,,Football is the game\N♪ 足球是我们的运动 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.60,0:00:16.63,,,0,0,0,,We're all together\N♪ 我们团结一心 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.63,0:00:18.63,,,0,0,0,,And winning is our aim\N♪ 赢得胜利是我们的目标 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.63,0:00:23.96,,,0,0,0,,So cheer us on through the sun and rain\N♪ 所以无论晴雨都为我们欢呼 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.96,0:00:28.55,,,0,0,0,,'Cause Chelsea, Chelsea is our name!\N♪ 因为切尔西，切尔西是我们的名字 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.28,0:00:33.98,,,0,0,0,,Here at the Bridge whether rain or fine\N♪ 在斯坦福桥，无论风雨 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.35,0:00:38.80,,,0,0,0,,We can shine all the time\N♪ 我们始终闪耀 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.80,0:00:43.73,,,0,0,0,,Home or away, come and see us play\N♪ 主场或客场，来看我们比赛 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.73,0:00:48.15,,,0,0,0,,You're welcome any day\N♪ 每天都欢迎你的到来 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.35,0:00:51.91,,,0,0,0,,Blue is the colour\N♪ 蓝色是我们的颜色 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.91,0:00:54.49,,,0,0,0,,Football is the game\N♪ 足球是我们的运动 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.49,0:00:56.17,,,0,0,0,,We're all together\N♪ 我们团结一心 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.17,0:00:58.70,,,0,0,0,,And winning is our aim\N♪ 赢得胜利是我们的目标 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.70,0:01:03.75,,,0,0,0,,So cheer us on through the sun and rain\N♪ 所以无论晴雨都为我们欢呼 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.75,0:01:08.40,,,0,0,0,,'Cause Chelsea, Chelsea is our name!\N♪ 因为切尔西，切尔西是我们的名字 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.25,0:01:14.10,,,0,0,0,,Come to the shed and we'll welcome you\N♪ 来到 Shed 看台，我们欢迎你 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.10,0:01:18.59,,,0,0,0,,Wear your blue and see us through\N♪ 穿上你的蓝色，见证我们的胜利 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.59,0:01:23.98,,,0,0,0,,Sing loud and clear till the game is won\N♪ 响亮而清晰地歌唱，直到赢得比赛 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.98,0:01:28.78,,,0,0,0,,Sing CHELSEA everyone!\N♪ 每个人都唱切尔西 ♪
